title The small box
intro A part of the field will glow. Then pick its name.
hide names
hide ball

step
  caption Look at the field. One part will glow yellow.

step
  draw goal-area left
  duration 400

question
  prompt What is this small box right at the goal called?
  answer Goal area
  wrong Penalty area
  wrong Center circle
  wrong Sideline
  correct Goal area.
  why The small box is the goal area. Goal kicks are taken from here.
